[Desktop Entry]
Type=Application
Name=BugOS look
Name[nl]=BugOS-stijl
Comment=Keeps the BugOS look on KDE, GTK and Flatpak programs, icons, the taskbar and the terminal
Comment[nl]=Houdt de BugOS-stijl op KDE-, GTK- en Flatpak-programma's, pictogrammen, de taakbalk en de terminal
Exec=bugos-thema inloggen
Icon=bugos-logo
OnlyShowIn=KDE;
X-KDE-autostart-phase=1
NoDisplay=true
